    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "H2800\nKOLOTEX\nAustralia\nSHEER RELIEF™\nWhat could be more tiring for your legs than being a flight attendant, where you\nhave to spend the whole day on your feet and still look your best. It's easy to see\nwhy Qantas flight attendants choose the comfort and support of Sheer Relief.\nMADE IN AUSTRALIA\nOnly Sheer Relief provides:\n1. Power yarn construction to soothe tired legs and\nincrease energy levels.\n2. A knitted in heel to create maximum compression\nat the ankle which helps increase\ncirculation back up your legs\n3. Graduated 20 denier medium compression\nto keep your legs looking as good as they feel\n4. Reinforced toe and heel for greater durability\n5. Flat locked seams for greater comfort and durability\n6. 100% natural cotton gusset.\n7. Sanitized® for lasting\nhygienic freshness.\nReinforced toe and heel for\ncomfort and durability\nIf your size falls within the highlighted area, you\nmay prefer to try the larger size\nExtra tall has an additional back panel.\n9310259\nSH RENTEE\nSH/S\nI/BEIGE\n302056\n982754\n541A\nHand wash in warm water using mild soap. Drip dry in shade. Do not iron.\nKeen separate from other carments when wet as cross staining may occur\nOANTAS uniforms designed by George Gross and Harry Who Australia\nHair and make-up by Joh Bailey Hairdressers\n70% NYLON 30% LYCRA® ELASTANE\nvera® is a Dupont trademark for its clastane fibee\nsisterstamarlal Sanitized Australia Piv ladi\nKolotex Australia and\nSheer Relief are trademarks of Kolotes Australia Py Lid 1008\nKolotex Australia. 22 George Street Leichhardi, Sydney NSW 2040 ACN 002 716 710",
      "LYCRA®\nFor Support,\nstyle \u0026 fit\nTALL\nMINI BEIGE\nKOLOTEX\nSHEER RELIEF\nSheer Support Pantihose"
    ],
